Title: The Lost Mitten
Cast: PIP=pip, TESS=turtle 6

FADE IN:

EXT. A MEADOW - MORNING

Pip and Ann stand in the grass. Tess the turtle watches.

PIP
(worried)
Have you seen my mitten? It is red.

ANN
(thinking)
A red mitten... I think Tess was sitting on it.

TESS
(surprised)
Me? Oh. Oh dear.

PIP
(laughing)
There it is! Thank you, Tess.

FADE OUT.
